  "suggestions": {
    "introduction": [
      "Hey, how is your day going? I love the bottlebrush by the door. I'm Alex, out with Placeholder Animal Rescue today. Have you heard much about what they do?"
    ],
    "problem": [
      "Honestly, the part that got me is how many animals are surrendered with nowhere to go. Have you heard much about that?",
      "And the shelters are full, so some get turned away. That's terrible, right? But there is hope."
    ],
    "solution": [
      "The rescued animals stay with foster carers until they find a home. Pretty incredible, right?",
      "A lot of your neighbours have already jumped on board, and without ongoing support the foster program can't continue."
    ],
    "close": [
      "So that's the reason we are out here. The rescue relies on regular support, so I assume we can count on your support too, yeah?",
      "What works best for you, monthly or annually?",
      "It's completely up to you. You choose an amount that works."
    ],
    "objection": [
      "I hear you. Can I ask, does the idea of what they are doing make sense to you?",
      "Exactly, and that is why most people start small. What works best for you, monthly or annually?",
      "You'd be directly helping an animal off the street, and it's completely up to you. You choose an amount that works."
    ],
    "consolidation": [
      "Brilliant, you are going to be making a real difference. Let me get you set up. What was your last name?",
      "And what works best for you, monthly or annually?",
      "Out of curiosity, what was the main reason you decided to jump on board?",
      "Thanks so much. Have a great day."
    ],
    "interruption": [
      "No worries, take your time."
    ],
